<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Set up administrator MFA</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="{ asset('css/admin/auth-mfa-enroll.css') }"></head><body><main><h1>Set up authenticator</h1><p>In your authenticator app, choose to add an account manually. Use this setup key. Keep it private.</p><p class="secret"><strong>{{ $secret }}</strong></p><p>Account type: time-based (TOTP), 6 digits, 30-second period.</p><details><summary>Authenticator setup URI</summary><p class="secret">{{ $uri }}</p></details><p>Enter the code shown in your authenticator to finish setup.</p>@if($errors->any())<p role="alert" class="error">{{ $errors->first() }}</p>@endif<form method="post" action="{{ route('admin.mfa.submit') }}">@csrf<label for="code">Authenticator code</label><input id="code" name="code" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" pattern="[0-9]{6}" maxlength="6" required><button type="submit">Verify and continue</button></form></main></body></html>
